# Uvagf · 48 · Yrnqre ryrpgvba: yrnfrf naq srapvat gbxraf

## Uvag 1

Fcyvg gur ceboyrz va gjb. Nyy gur qrpvfvbaf nobhg n fvatyr yrnfr (jub znl jevgr jung, naq juvpu
rcbpu) yvir va Arkg, n cher shapgvba lbh pna grfg jvgu n gnoyr. Gur Eha ybbc bayl qbrf gur rssrpgf:
ernq gur pybpx, pnyy gur fgber, jnvg, fgneg naq fgbc gur pnyyonpx. Jevgr Arkg, ZrzbelFgber naq
SraprqErfbhepr svefg: rnpu vf n srj yvarf, naq rnpu vf bar vqrn (rkcvel, pbzcner-naq-fjnc, n
zbabgbavp gbxra). Gura qenj Eha nf n fznyy fgngr znpuvar ba cncre: pnaqvqngr → yrnqre → fgbccrq.
Sbe rnpu fgngr, yvfg gur riragf (gvpx, fgber nafjrerq, fgber snvyrq, nabgure ubyqre frra, qrnqyvar
cnffrq, pgk pnapryyrq) naq jung Eha qbrf sbe rnpu bar.

## Uvag 2

Guerr guvatf qrpvqr jurgure Eha vf fnsr. Svefg, rirel jevgr tbrf guebhtu Hcqngr jvgu gur Irefvba
lbh ernq, fb gjb pnaqvqngrf pna arire obgu jva; n pbasyvpg vf whfg n snvyrq nggrzcg. Frpbaq, gur
erarj qrnqyvar vf zrnfherq sebz gur ErarjGvzr lbh jebgr va lbhe ynfg *fhpprffshy* erarj, naq ab
fvatyr fgber pnyy znl eha cnfg gung qrnqyvar: tvir rnpu erarj nggrzcg n pgk jvgu n gvzrbhg bs
"qrnqyvar zvahf Abj()". N cnegvgvba unatf, vg qbrf abg snvy. Guveq, gur beqre ng gur raq znggref:
pnapry gur yrnqre'f pgk, jnvg sbe BaFgnegrqYrnqvat gb erghea (n `qbar` punaary gung gur tbebhgvar
pybfrf), pnyy BaFgbccrqYrnqvat, naq bayl gura eryrnfr. Eryrnfrq rneyvre, nabgure pnaqvqngr pna
fgneg juvyr lbhef fgvyy jbexf. Gur eryrnfr vgfrys arrqf n pbagrkg gung vf abg pnapryyrq, orpnhfr
Eha'f pgk vf: `pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry`, cyhf n gvzrbhg.

## Uvag 3

- Arkg: vs gur ubyqre vf vq, pbcl phe naq frg ErarjGvzr naq Qhengvba. Ryfr vs gur ubyqre vf rzcgl be
  `!abj.Orsber(phe.ErarjGvzr.Nqq(phe.Qhengvba))`, ohvyq n arj yrnfr jvgu Rcbpu + 1 naq
  `Irefvba: phe.Irefvba`. Ryfr erghea phe, snyfr.
- ZrzbelFgber: n zhgrk naq bar Yrnfr. Purpx `pgk.Ree()` svefg. Va Hcqngr, pbzcner gur irefvbaf naq
  fgber haqre gur fnzr ybpx.
- SraprqErfbhepr: n zhgrk, gur uvturfg gbxra naq gur inyhr. Erwrpg `gbxra < uvturfg`.
- Eha: Inyvqngr; qrsnhyg Abj gb gvzr.Abj; xrrc n fznyy fgehpg jvgu gur pbasvt, gur pybpx naq gur
  ynfg ercbegrq ubyqre (bayl Eha'f tbebhgvar gbhpurf vg, fb ab ybpx).
- Pnaqvqngr ybbc: purpx `pgk.Ree()`; nggrzcg (Trg, ercbeg gur ubyqre, Arkg, Hcqngr); ba fhpprff
  ercbeg lbhefrys naq erghea gur yrnfr; bgurejvfr jnvg sbe n gvpxre gvpx be pgk.Qbar.
- Yrnqre: qrevir `yrnqrePgk` jvgu JvguPnapry, fgneg BaFgnegrqYrnqvat va n tbebhgvar gung pybfrf n
  punaary jura vg ergheaf, gura eha gur erarj ybbc.
- Erarj ybbc, ba rirel gvpx: qrnqyvar = ynfgErarj + ErarjQrnqyvar. Vs Abj vf abg orsber vg, lbh
  ybfg. Bgurejvfr nggrzcg jvgu n pgk obhaqrq ol gur gvzr yrsg: Trg; vs gur ubyqre vf abg lbh, lbh
  ybfg ng bapr; ryfr Hcqngr jvgu Arkg'f yrnfr. Ba fhpprff, ynfgErarj = gur ErarjGvzr lbh jebgr. Ba n
  snvyher, vs pgk vf qbar erghea pgk.Ree(); vs gur qrnqyvar unf abj cnffrq, lbh ybfg; bgurejvfr
  jnvg sbe gur arkg gvpx.
- Nsgre gur ybbc: pnapry, jnvg sbe gur punaary, BaFgbccrqYrnqvat, eryrnfr vs pgk jnf pnapryyrq naq
  EryrnfrBaPnapry vf frg (Trg; bayl vs gur ubyqre vf fgvyy lbh, Hcqngr jvgu Ubyqre ""), erghea.
